### Migration and Compatibility

#### Legacy Support
- All legacy `terms()` method calls have been updated to `user_instance_index()`
- Database migration completed from `terms` to `user_instance_index` fields
- API maintains backward compatibility during transition periods

#### Breaking Changes Protocol
1. Update trait method signatures first
2. Update all implementations simultaneously
3. Update API endpoints and request/response types
4. Update CLI integration
5. Update frontend integration
6. Verify end-to-end consistency

